ic","site_admin":false},"body":"Local UI invalidation now clears the view and aborts its current read on explicit read-loss, stale revision/authority, generation-change and connection signals. Invalid signals clear first and fail closed; delayed bytes cannot restore an invalidated view. Recovery requires a new explicit begin().\n\nThis is an owned client extension, stacked on PR #81 at immutable base 8599630158bc889379d9b5088c11a0457dd6672c. It does not bind an endpoint, interpret backend authorization claims, fetch/retry, grant READ or promote any response to scientific data. A2 scientific READ/final visibility and A4 controlled reader/revision authority APIs remain NONE; Root wire/error/source ACK is pending. Overall integration NO-GO.\n\nValidation: six new recovery tests observed RED before implementation; 30/30 explicitly selected PURE controls now pass. Raw-source qualification at dc810b03c3accf0e6f28fca1d5068f4171bb909d verifies all 402 Git blobs before/after (Node v24.22.1). Independent scoped review: no actionable P0/P1/P2. Windows/Linux source CI is separate; no SDK/browser/native/Office/physical fixture ran. The 30 controls are not the 25 Sync Contract scenarios or backend RBAC/runtime acceptance.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-10T17:32:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:32:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2a7097fdf264c335159bae5c928c574b793a7843","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:feature/scientific-read-recovery-20261110","ref":"feature/scientific-read-recovery-20261110","repo":{"id":1413341784,"node_id":"R_kgDOVD3iWA","name":"Terminan","full_name":"YehorBabenko88/Terminan","owner":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.co